{ Commands: m, r and %include }
{ Note: :N adds N, ;N subtracts N (these are not assignments!) }

%lib.bsh

{ macros from the included file are available }
@hi
@countdown

{ m — multiply the current cell by the cell on the right: 5 * 7 = 35 }
:5 >:7 < m #

{ m wraps like any other cell value: 255 * 3 = 765 -> 253 }
>[-] :3 <[-] :255 m #

{ r — put a random number from 1 to 255 into the cell
  the value changes on every run }
[-] r #

{ @square from the library: 6 * 6 = 36 }
>[-] :6 <[-] :6 @square #